---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const facts = [['Status', 'PROTOTYPE'], ['Category', 'Faith + Technology'], ['Origin', 'BLOSSOM Product Lab'], ['Current phase', 'Defining the first version']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Bible Arena — BLOSSOM" description="Bible Arena is a Bible-centered competitive learning platform currently being developed by BLOSSOM.">
  <main><section class="product-detail-hero"><div class="section"><div class="detail-breadcrumb"><a href="/products">Products</a><span>/</span><span>Bible Arena</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Flagship product / 01</p><h1>Bible<br /><em>Arena.</em></h1><p class="detail-tagline">Make Scripture discovery a practice you want to return to.</p><div class="detail-actions"><span class="directory-status prototype">PROTOTYPE</span><a href="mailto:michaelolaoluwag@gmail.com?subject=Bible Arena beta interest" class="pill-button">Join the beta conversation →</a></div></div><div class="detail-art"><div class="arena-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="arena-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="arena-mark">BA</div></div></section><section class="section detail-body"><div class="detail-facts">{facts.map(([label, value]) => <div><span class="eyebrow">{label}</span><strong>{value}</strong></div>)}</div><div class="detail-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>How do we help people engage Scripture with more curiosity, memory and joy?</h2></div><div class="reading-copy"><p>Bible Arena is being explored as a Bible-centered competitive trivia and learning platform. The ambition is to combine learning, friendly competition and collaboration without losing the depth or reverence of the source material.</p><p>The product direction is still being shaped. That means some ideas are being tested, some are being researched, and some have not been committed to yet.</p></div></div><div class="detail-grid detail-grid-border"><div><p class="eyebrow">The current direction</p><h2>Learn. Practice. Compete. Return.</h2></div><div class="feature-list"><span>Bible quiz</span><span>Daily challenge</span><span>Word puzzle</span><span>Friendly competition</span><span>Progress and streaks</span><span>Future multiplayer exploration</span></div></div><div class="detail-grid detail-grid-border"><div><p class="eyebrow">What's next</p><h2>Testing the first version with real people.</h2></div><div class="reading-copy"><p>We are working toward a focused first experience before expanding the product. If you care about Bible learning, product design, technology or creative circle, we would value your perspective.</p><a href="/join" class="text-link">Find your way into BLOSSOM <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class="detail-grid detail-grid-border"><div><p class="eyebrow">Product record</p><h2>What is verified so far.</h2></div><div class="reading-copy"><p><strong>Who it is for.</strong> People who want to explore Scripture through focused learning and friendly competition.</p><p><strong>Verified direction.</strong> Bible quiz, daily challenge, word puzzle, progress and streaks are current product ideas under exploration — not shipped features.</p><p><strong>Technology.</strong> The technical stack is not publicly documented yet.</p><p><strong>Team.</strong> BLOSSOM Product Lab. Named team details are not published yet.</p><p><strong>Version.</strong> First-version definition.</p></div></div><div class="empty-state"><p class="eyebrow">Screenshots and external link</p><p>More is coming. This part of BLOSSOM is still being built. Product screenshots and a public test link will appear when there is a real experience to show.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
